      "rule": "Author front, left, right and rear elevations for every asset, including courtyard walls. Material courses, cornices, balconies, window returns and roof logic continue around exposed sides and corners; secondary elevations remain stylistically related but use a believable different opening and service hierarchy. Detail may be occluded only when site geometry confirms a true party wall."
